，言：往者达之去就〖19〗，明公切齿〖20〗；欲诛达妻子，赖先（主）〔帝〕不听耳〖21〗。达曰：‘诸葛亮见顾有本末〖22〗，终不尔也〖23〗。’尽不信冲言，委仰明公，无复已已〖24〗。”","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-e9b66b831192e486b700","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-0331bba35be1e9a1beba","layer":"original","quote":"降人李鸿来诣亮，亮见鸿，时蒋琬与诗在坐","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q2-9e177f5b6dfe6af6bee0","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-0331bba35be1e9a1beba","layer":"original","quote":"建兴三年，随诸葛亮南行，归至汉阳县〖17〗。降人李鸿来诣亮，亮见鸿，时蒋琬与诗在坐。鸿曰：“间过孟达许〖18〗，适见王冲从南来，言：往者达之去就〖19〗，明公切齿〖20〗；欲诛达妻子，赖先（主）〔帝〕不听耳〖21〗。达曰：‘诸葛亮见顾有本末〖22〗，终不尔也〖23〗。’尽不信冲言，委仰明公，无复已已〖24〗。”","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":172,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
